# CHEY-2019-02-01 packet-32

*Agenda packet item from the City Council — Friday, February 1, 2019 meeting, City of Cheyenne, Wyoming. Plain-text copy for reading and search. The original file is the authoritative version.*

- **Meeting:** [City Council — Friday, February 1, 2019](../../../meetings/2019/city-council-2019-02-01.md)
- **Document type:** Agenda packet item
- **Text status:** full text
- **Pages:** 7
- **Original file:** [agenda-packets/CHEY-2019-02-01_packet-32.pdf](https://github.com/therealwindycity/cheyenne-archives-2018-2021/blob/main/agenda-packets/CHEY-2019-02-01_packet-32.pdf) in `therealwindycity/cheyenne-archives-2018-2021` ([direct download](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/therealwindycity/cheyenne-archives-2018-2021/main/agenda-packets/CHEY-2019-02-01_packet-32.pdf))
- **File size:** 400,937 bytes · git blob `c0a94a7d4b76`
- **Extraction:** PyMuPDF text layer. Wording is unchanged; line breaks and table layout may differ from the PDF.

